/target
# Cargo.lock is committed: this workspace produces installable binaries
# (mct-cli, mct-mcp-server), not just libraries — reproducible builds matter.
.mct-index/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
.env
.env.*

# Local-only: records this machine's absolute --root path, not portable
# to another contributor's checkout location.
.mcp.json

# Session-local Claude Code state — not portable across contributors/machines
.claude/
# Pre-rename index directories, still present in older checkouts or created
# by a stale globally-installed pre-rename binary
.claude-index/
.ccm-index/

# Windows/native build byproducts (defensive; today only appear under
# already-ignored fuzz/target/, this guards future root-level artifacts)
*.pdb
*.exe

# Obsidian workspace state (per-user editor state, not vault content)
.obsidian/

# Local-only: auto-generated GitHub issues status snapshot, not source of truth
issues.md

# Local-only: default indexing-exclusions stub, not customized/shared yet
.mctignore

# Local-only Codex config may hold credentials; share only the project's hooks file and the sanitized template.
.codex/
!.codex/
.codex/*
!.codex/hooks.json
!.codex/config.example.toml
